description=94%20Diskont%20is%20undoubtedly%20a%20standout%20in%20the%20field%20of%20electronically%20advanced%2C%20glitch-heavy%20music.%20In%20addition%20to%20having%20clear%20resonance%20with%20those%20primarily%20interested%20in%20process%2C%20this%20record%20resides%20in%20an%20autonomous%20and%20highly%20aesthetic%20sonic%20universe%2C%20where%20bits%20of%20production%20and%20granulated%20noise%20easily%20melt%20into%20warm%2C%20repetitive%20arrangements.%2094%20Diskont%20was%20made%20with%20a%20lot%20of%20productive%20mediation%20and%20gadgetry%2C%20but%20the%20seams%20don%27t%20show.%20The%20textures%20are%20thick%20and%20the%20melodies%20are%20challenging%2C%20nowhere%20more%20so%20than%20on%20the%20epic%20opening%20track%20%22Do%20While.%22%20%20At%2024%20minutes%2C%20Oval%20take%20their%20time%2C%20but%20this%20is%20deep%20listening%2C%20and%20anything%20shorter%20just%20wouldn%27t%20do.%20A%20distant%20and%20fractured%20bell%20sound%20competes%20with%20a%20decaying%2C%20four-note%20organ%20swell%20for%20the%20majority%20of%20the%20song%2C%20while%20clicks%20and%20unidentified%20manipulations%20make%20their%20way%20in%20and%20out%20of%20the%20mix.%20Rhythm%20and%20melody%20emerge%20from%20unexpected%20places.%20What%20you%20initially%20take%20to%20be%20white%20noise%20settles%20into%20an%20odd%20but%20discernible%20pattern.%20The%20clicks%20between%20a%20skipping%20CD%20become%20an%20essential%20part%20of%20%22Shop%20in%20Store.%22%20%20But%20perhaps%20even%20more%20impressive%20is%20when%20rhythm%20and%20melody%20barely%20emerge%20at%20all.%20The%20uncommon%20range%20of%2094%20Diskont%20is%20indeed%20one%20of%20its%20most%20powerful%20qualities.%20%20%E2%80%94Ben%20Tausig%2C%20AllMusic%20%285/5%29%0D%0A%0D%0ACredits%20%E2%96%BC%0D%0A%0D%0APerformer%20-%20Frank%20Metzger%2C%20Markus%20Popp%2C%20Sebastian%20Oschatz%0D%0A%0D%0ANotes%20%E2%96%BC%0D%0A%0D%0APrinted%20and%20manufactured%20in%20Canada%0D%0A%0D%0AReleased%20in%20a%20clear%20tray%20Digipak%0D%0AD