comment=DOGA%2C%20new%20studio%20album%20by%20Juana%20Molina%2C%20the%20eighth%20full-length%20of%20her%20career%20and%20her%20first%20album%20of%20new%20compositions%20in%20eight%20years.%0D%0A%0D%0AA%20record%20that%20took%20almost%20six%20years%20to%20brew.%20It%20was%20like%20preparing%20a%20meal%20for%20six%20diners%20with%20ingredients%20for%20an%20army.%20The%20overwhelming%20amount%20of%20recordings%20paralyzed%20Juana%20to%20the%20point%20that%2C%20at%20one%20moment%2C%20she%20thought%20there%20was%20no%20way%20to%20make%20an%20album.%0D%0A%0D%0A%E2%80%9CWhenever%20I%20finish%20making%20an%20album%20there%E2%80%99s%20an%20inertia%20that%20makes%20me%20keep%20recording%2C%E2%80%9D%20she%20says%2C%20but%20we%20can%20place%20the%20beginning%20of%20the%20composition%20and%20recording%20process%20for%20this%20new%20work%20in%202019%2C%20during%20the%20preparation%20for%20a%20series%20of%20concerts%20called%20%E2%80%9CImproviset%E2%80%9D%2C%20which%20Juana%20performed%20with%20keyboardist%20Od%C3%ADn%20Schwartz.%0D%0A%0D%0A%E2%80%9CThe%20idea%20was%20to%20play%20as%20if%20I%20were%20at%20home%2C%20that%20is%2C%20to%20improvise%2C%E2%80%9D%20Juana%20explains.%20%E2%80%9CIt%20was%20a%20duo%20mostly%20of%20analog%20synthesizers%20and%20sequencers.%20We%20recorded%20everything%E2%80%94so%20many%20hours%E2%80%94because%20there%20was%20no%20way%20to%20reproduce%20what%20we%20did%3B%20both%20rehearsals%20and%20shows%20were%20unique.%20Some%20of%20those%20ideas%20were%20later%20picked%20up%20again.%E2%80%9D%0D%0A%0D%0AWhen%20the%20world%20closed%20down%20because%20of%20the%20pandemic%2C%20Juana%20was%20finishing%20her%20set%20on%20the%20stage%20of%20the%20NRMAL%20Festival%20in%20Mexico%20City%20on%20March%206%2C%202020.%20That%20Mexican%20performance%20became%20her%20first%20live%20album%3A%20ANRMAL%20%28RGS/Crammed%2C%202020%29%2C%20an%20excellent%20live%20document%20featuring%20a%20setlist%20based%20on%20Wed%2021%20%282013%29%2C%20Halo%20%282017%29%20and%20the%20rework%20EP%20Forfun%20%282019%29.%0D%0A%0D%0AThe%20end%20of%20the%20pandemic%20brought%20developments%20in%20several%20directions%3A%20together%20with%20her%20producer%20and%20current%20manager%20Mario%20Agust%C3%ADn%20de%20Jes%C3%BAs%20Gonz%C3%A1lez%20%28aka%20Marito%29%2C%20Juana%20founded%20Sonamos%20label%2C%20which%20released%2C%20among%20other%20titles%2C%20magnificent%20anniversary%20reissues%20such%20as%20Musicasi%C3%B3n%204%20%C2%BD%20%281971%2C%20the%20foundational%20candombe-beat%20%C3%A1lbum%20from%20Uruguay%29%20and%20Molina%E2%80%99s%20Segundo%20%282000%2C%20a%20key%20record%20in%20the%20artist%E2%80%99s%20own%20discography%29.%20She%20also%20returned%20to%20performing%20in%20various%20formats%20%28solo%20sets%2C%20%E2%80%9CImproviset%E2%80%9D%20with%20Od%C3%ADn%20Schwartz%2C%20or%20duo%20with%20drummer%20Diego%20L%C3%B3pez%20de%20Arcaute%29%20across%20the%20United%20States%2C%20Europe%20and%20Asia%2C%20and%20severed%20contractual%20ties%20with%20the%20record%20companies%20that%20had%20previously%20released%20her%20work%20in%20different%20regions.%20In%20doing%20so%2C%20Juana%20became%20exclusively%20her%20own%20artist.%0D%0A%0D%0AMeanwhile%2C%20the%20new%20material%20continued%20to%20pulse%2C%20and%20in%20spring%202022%20she%20booked%20ten%20days%20at%20Sonor%C3%A1mica%20studio%20in%20C%C3%B3rdoba%2C%20Argentina.%20%E2%80%9CWe%20brought%20a%20preselection%20of%20the%20Improviset%20recordings%2C%20and%20there%20the%20ideas%20for%20new%20songs%20appeared%20more%20clearly%2C%E2%80%9D%20she%20says.%0D%0A%0D%0ARiding%20that%20C%C3%B3rdoba%20momentum%2C%20her%20home%20studio%20in%20the%20Buenos%20Aires%20suburbs%20became%20the%20refuge%20for%20long%2C%20sprawling%20sessions.%20By%20mid-2024%20five%20songs%20were%20already%20sketched%20out%20and%20there%20remained%20an%20ocean%20of%20recordings%20to%20dive%20into%20and%20try%20to%20surface%20with%20an%20album.%20%E2%80%9CAfter%20Sonor%C3%A1mica%20I%20spent%20two%20more%20years%20composing%3B%20I%20felt%20I%20had%20nothing.%20Until%20one%20day%20Marito%20started%20organizing%20what%20I%20had%20and%20we%20saw%20we%E2%80%99d%20reached%2030%20hours%20of%20ideas.%20That%20sparked%20enthusiasm%20but%20at%20the%20same%20time%20it%20paralyzed%20me%20having%20to%20decide%20which%20direction%20to%20take%2C%20because%20there%20were%20very%20dissimilar%20things.%20We%20even%20fantasized%20about%20making%20a%20triple%20album%2C%20one%20of%20them%20instrumental.%E2%80%9D%0D%0A%0D%0AAt%20the%20beginning%20of%202024%2C%20Mario%20proposed%20finishing%20the%20work%20with%20an%20external%20producer%2C%20someone%20with%20fresh%20ears%20for%20the%20new%20material.%20In%20that%20context%2C%20Emilio%20Haro%20emerged%2C%20familiar%20to%20the%20team%20for%20his%20production%20on%20Carolo%E2%80%99s%20debut%20LP%2C%20released%20by%20Sonamos%20in%202023.%0D%0A%0D%0AEmilio%20Haro%20joined%20the%20project%20in%20its%20final%20stage%2C%20but%20his%20imprint%20was%20perhaps%20decisive%3A%20%E2%80%9CHe%20got%20very%20excited%20from%20the%20start%2C%20and%20I%20could%20say%20he%20got%20more%20out%20of%20me%20than%20anyone%20before%2C%E2%80%9D%20Juana%20concludes.%20%E2%80%9CI%20would%20record%20a%20guitar%20and%20he%E2%80%99d%20tell%20me%20to%20record%20more%E2%80%94different%20sounds%2C%20different%20arrangements%2C%20different%20ideas.%20Then%20he%20would%20take%20the%20recordings%20and%20program%20things%20on%20his%20own%3B%20many%20of%20those%20elements%20ended%20up%20on%20the%20record.%20I%20like%20his%20overall%20sense%20of%20the%20songs%2C%20the%20aesthetic%20of%20the%20mixes.%20I%E2%80%99m%20more%20of%20a%20straightforward%20person%3B%20I%20don%E2%80%99t%20usually%20use%20post-recording%20effects%2C%20and%20I%20thought%20Emilio%20had%20great%20command%20for%20creating%20spaces%20around%20things.%E2%80%9D%0D%0A%0D%0AComprised%20of%2010%20tracks%20spread%20across%204%20sides%20of%20a%20double%20LP%20at%2045%20rpm%2C%20bearing%20its%20polysemous%20title%2C%20with%20extraordinary%20cover%20art%20by%20Alejandro%20Ros%20and%20proudly%20produced%20entirely%20by%20Sonamos%2C%20DOGA%20automatically%20takes%20its%20place%20in%20the%20unique%20territory%20of%20popular%20music%20that%20is%20Juana%20Molina%E2%80%99s%20records.%0D%0A%0D%0AThe%20album%20concentrates%20all%20the%20qualities%20that%20define%20Juana%20Molina%E2%80%99s%20music%20and%20goes%20a%20step%20further%20in%20the%20constant%20pursuit%20of%20the%20singular%2C%20where%20influences%20are%20hard%20to%20detect%E2%80%94genuinely%20original%2C%20literally%20unlike%20anything%20else.%20Unexpected%20melodies%2C%20ethereal%2C%20organic%20sounds%2C%20minimalist%20and%20subtle%20gestures%2C%20repetition%20as%20an%20aesthetic%2C%20austere%2C%20seemingly%20static%20harmony%2C%20lyrics%20as%20concentric%20layers%3A%20a%20familiar%20but%20always%20surprising%20landscape%20for%20the%20artist%E2%80%99s%20regular%20audience%20and%20an%20excellent%20doorway%20for%20newcomers%20to%20the%20world%20of%20Juana%20Molina.%20%0D%0Acredits%0D%0Areleases%20November%205%2C%202025%0D%0A%0D%0AProduced%20by%20Juana%20Molina%20and%20Emilio%20Haro%2C%20except%20%22Miro%20todo%22%2C%20produced%20by%20JM%2C%20Haro%20and%20Mario%20Agust%C3%ADn%20de%20Jes%C3%BAs%20Gonz%C3%A1lez.%0D%0A%0D%0AMixed%20by%20Emilio%20Haro%20and%20Juana%20Molina.%0D%0AMastered%20by%20Daniel%20Osorio%20at%20El%20%C3%81ngel%20Estudio.%0D%0AProduction%20Assistant%3A%20Mario%20Agust%C3%ADn%20de%20Jes%C3%BAs%20Gonz%C3%A1lez.%0D%0A%0D%0ARecorded%20between%202020%20and%202025%20at%20home%20%28Buenos%20Aires%2C%20Argentina%29%20by%20JM%2C%20and%20at%20Sonor%C3%A1mica%20%28Traslasierra%2C%20C%C3%B3rdoba%2C%20Argentina%29%20by%20Mat%C3%ADas%20Sznaider.%20%22Caravanas%22%20and%20%22Va%20rara%22%20recorded%20at%20Hotel2Tango%20%28Montreal%2C%20Canada%29%20by%20Howard%20Billerman%20under%20the%20executive%20production%20of%20Leslie%20Feist%20and%20Andrew%20Barr.%0D%0A%0D%0ARecording%20assistants%3A%20Odin%20Schwartz%20%282020%29%2C%20Mario%20Agust%C3%ADn%20de%20Jes%C3%BAs%20Gonz