description=Seductive%20singer/songwriter%20and%20producer%20Poe%20returns%20with%20a%20bombastic%20second%20release%20Haunted%2C%20making%20for%20a%20mind-blowing%20intimate%20account%20of%20her%20relationship%20with%20her%20father%2C%20well-known%20lecturer%20and%20talented%20documentary%20filmmaker%20Tad%20Danielewski.%20Shifting%20around%20the%20gnarling%20reign%20of%20powerhouse%20femininity%20draped%20over%20her%20debut%20Hello%20%281995%29%2C%20Poe%20is%20much%20stronger%20on%20Haunted%27s%20layers%20of%20therapy%2C%20and%20that%27s%20certainly%20impressive%20for%20a%20sophomore%20effort.%20She%20splices%20in%20spooky%20stints%20of%20her%20late%20father%27s%20recorded%20voice%20to%20converse%20with%20him%20in%20an%20attempt%20at%20closeness%2C%20therefore%20making%20Haunted%20a%20story%20of%20sorts.%20It%20is%20more%20like%20a%20story%20anyway%3A%20Poe%27s%20novelist%20brother%20Mark%20Z.%20Danielewski%20wrote%20The%20House%20of%20Leaves%20%282000%29%2C%20and%20the%20music%20found%20on%20Haunted%20is%20an%20eerie%20account%20of%20the%20book%20itself%2C%20serving%20cathartic%20measures%20for%20both%20Poe%20and%20her%20brother.%0D%0A%0D%0AThe%20overall%20album%20is%20sexy%2C%20in%20fact%20hauntingly%20so%20with%20Poe%27s%20vocals%20growling%20and%20bellowing%20for%20self-appreciation%20and%20individualism%2C%20especially%20on%20the%20title%20track%20and%20%22Control.%22%20The%20third%20song%20into%20the%20record%2C%20%22Control%22%20is%20an%20excellent%20track%20with%20crashing%20percussion%20and%20mysterious%20backdrops%20from%20her%20father%2C%20which%20are%20layered%20over%20goth-like%20string%20arrangements%20and%20Poe%27s%20emotional%20roar.%20The%20quick%20flamenco%20stylings%20of%20%22Spanish%20Doll%22%20are%20sheer%20in%20the%20face%20of%20the%20tempestuous%20%22Walk%20the%20Walk%2C%22%20and%20%22Wild%22%20keeps%20up%20with%20the%20bold%20in%20the%20midst%20of%20its%20brisk%2C%20moody%20complexity%20due%20to%20Poe%27s%20self-searching%20process%20of%20acceptance%20and%20retaliation%20at%20being%20disregarded.%20Haunted%27s%20initial%20concept%20alone%20alone%20is%20brilliant.%20Poe%20has%20outdone%20herself%20creatively%20and%20artistically%3B%20the%20drum%20machines%20and%20overlapping%20guitar%20riffs%20among%20her%20sampled%20vocals%20and%20stretched%20lyrics%20make%20this%20album%20more%20of%20a%20modern-day%20epic.%20It%20is%20also%20a%20sweet%20tribute%20to%20her%20late%20father%2C%20and%20a%20nice%20composite%20to%20speak%20to%20him.%20Sadly%2C%20Poe%27s%20work%20might%20not%20be%20welcomed%20in%20the%20mainstream%2C%20which%20is%20disappointing%20because%20her%20original%20compositions%20have%20the%20makings%20for%20a%20new%20music%20revolution%20alongside%20the%20likes%20of%20Radiohead%27s%20Kid%20A.%20Haunted%20is%20in%20its%20own%20class%20of%20twisted%20intelligence%20and%20beauty.%20
