cceptance%20and%20retaliation%20at%20being%20disregarded.%20Haunted%27s%20initial%20concept%20alone%20alone%20is%20brilliant.%20Poe%20has%20outdone%20herself%20creatively%20and%20artistically%3B%20the%20drum%20machines%20and%20overlapping%20guitar%20riffs%20among%20her%20sampled%20vocals%20and%20stretched%20lyrics%20make%20this%20album%20more%20of%20a%20modern-day%20epic.%20It%20is%20also%20a%20sweet%20tribute%20to%20her%20late%20father%2C%20and%20a%20nice%20composite%20to%20speak%20to%20him.%20Sadly%2C%20Poe%27s%20work%20might%20not%20be%20welcomed%20in%20the%20mainstream%2C%20which%20is%20disappointing%20because%20her%20original%20compositions%20have%20the%20makings%20for%20a%20new%20music%20revolution%20alongside%20the%20likes%20of%20Radiohead%27s%20Kid%20A.%20Haunted%20is%20in%20its%20own%20class%20of%20twisted%20intelligence%20and%20beauty.%20
