lyrics=Couldn%E2%80%99t%20feel%20through%20the%20current%0AAll%20the%20dead%20fishes%20swim%20downstream%0AMissing%20my%20reflection%0AAll%20the%20raindrops%20come%20through%20and%20by%0A%0ANever%20echoes%20stalled%20mistakes%0ARush%20to%20forget%20excuses%0APresence%20fleeting%20from%20my%20hand%0AWhere%20is%20acceptance%3F%0A%0ATwisted%20walls%20I%20built%20inside%0AThe%20fragments%20flutter%20close%20by%0AWaiting%20for%20no%0AExit%20left%20me%20all%20time%0ADaily%20spent%20in%20static%0AHoping%20minutes%20decide%0AEvery%20weight%20drowning%0A%0ATwisted%20roots%20on%20me%0ATwisted%20roots%20on%20me%0ATwisted%20roots%20on%20me%0ATwisted%20roots%20on%20me%0ATwisted%20roots%20on%20me%0ATwisted%20roots%20on%20me%0ATwisted%20roots%20on%20me%0ATwisted%20roots%20on%20me%0A%0AShould%20have%20wrapped%20my%20arms%20along%20a%20fence%0ALet%20the%20barbed%20wire%20rip%20my%20dreams%20out%0AAs%20I%20reach%20for%20some%20greener%20weeds%0AWishing%20the%20currents%20led%20me%20to%0ATake%20my%20breath%2C%20lose%20my%20face%0AAnd%20when%20I%20sink%20in%20here%0A%0AStill%20the%20tide%20doesn%27t%20turn%20for%20me%0AFill%20the%20quiet%20with%20words%20I%20throw%0AStill%20the%20sky%20won%E2%80%99t%20bend%20to%20see%0AEvery%20river%E2%80%99s%20just%20lying%0A%0AFalse%20currents%20carry%20me%0AWhile%20I%20let%20life%20bleed%20away%0ACover%20scars%20pulling%20deep%0AHas%20this%20already%20been%20before%3F%0A%0AAll%20my%20edges%20start%20to%20blur%0AMisplaced%20hands%20through%20the%20bracken%0ATurned%20over%2C%20every%20fear%0AAnd%20broken%20glass%20shelters%20me%0AReflections%2C%20everything%20wrong%0AFolding%20in%2C%20everything%0ACrumbing%20under%20some%20breathless%20screen%0ASearching%20for%20real%20light%0A%0ANever%20echoes%20stalled%20mistakes%0ARush%20to%20forget%20excuses%0APresence%20fleeting%20from%20my%20hand%0AWhere%20is%20acceptance%3F%0A%0AWhen%20I%20try%20all%20my%20best%0AMy%20best%20isn%27t%20good%20enough%0AFor%20you%20to%20make%20me%20feel%20alright%0ALies%20distort%20in%20your%20shape%0AI%20can%27t%20find%20myself%0ATearing%20at%20seams%20I%20stitched%20alone%0AI%20can%E2%80%99t%20last%20anymore%0ASpit%20out%20my%20words%20i%20swallowed%0AWhy%20push%20through%20in%20hell%3F
