lyrics=A%20blueprint%20tainted%0ATorn%20up%20plans%20with%20our%20names%20on%20it%0A%0A%28You%20wanna%20build%20from%20the%20ground%20up%20thats%20made%20of%20lies%20and%20regret%0AWeightless%20foundation%20made%20of%20hopes%20and%20dreams%2C%20whatever%27s%20in%20kept%29%0A%0ASame%20eyes%2C%20same%20face%0AThere%27s%20a%20stranger%20in%20my%20skin%0A%0A%28So%20plant%20nothing%20but%20don%27t%20complain%20theres%20not%20a%20harvest%20again%0AYou%20only%20moved%20on%20the%20impulse%20that%20lived%20as%20long%20as%20a%20breath%29%0A%0ABeen%20holding%20this%20in%20all%20our%20lives%0ALet%20go%20a%20million%20wasted%20nights%0ATears%20in%20my%20jeans%20can%27t%20even%20cry%0AThere%27s%20no%20more%20lying%20in%20me%2C%20the%20wheels%20are%20off%20now%20to%20me%0A%0A%0AThe%20weekdays%20are%20blurring%0AYour%20schedules%20are%20lined%20the%20same%0A%0A%28You%27ll%20look%20more%20different%20if%20you%20just%20took%20your%20eyes%20off%20the%20mirror%0AYou%20wont%20learn%20anything%20when%20the%20choice%20you%20make%20is%20nothing%20but%20clearer%29%0A%0AYour%20blessings%20are%20washed%20away%0ALike%20trails%20in%20the%20sand%0A%0A%28Why%20even%20bother%20the%20stars%2C%20look%20at%20the%20masses%20below%0AThat%20gives%20you%20no%20right%20to%20lowering%20the%20standards%20of%20your%20own%29%0A%0ABeen%20holding%20this%20in%20all%20our%20lives%0ALet%20go%20a%20million%20wasted%20nights%0ATears%20in%20my%20jeans%20can%27t%20even%20cry%0AThere%27s%20no%20more%20lying%20in%20me%2C%20the%20wheels%20are%20off%20now%20to%20me%0A%0AOur%20flames%20are%20burnt%20out%20and%20our%20candles%20are%20wax%0AMy%20motivation%20was%20all%20left%20in%20the%20past%0AMaybe%20pursue%20the%20dreams%20that%20made%20us%20grow%0ADo%20draw%20your%20own%20circle%2C%20abstain%20from%20the%20dangerous%20glow%0AWhy%20don%27t%20you%20know%20there%20is%20no%20end%20of%20the%20rope%0ASo%20make%20a%20knot%20thats%20not%20a%20half%20tied%20bow%0AI%20can%27t%20believe%20you%20waited%20just%20to%20lose%20hope%20%0