lyrics=How%20can%20anyone%20love%20me%20with%20this%20shitty%20voice%0AHow%20can%20anyone%20love%20me%20with%20this%20ugly%20body%0AHow%20can%20anyone%20love%20me%20with%20this%20stupid%20hair%0AHow%20can%20anyone%20love%20me%20with%20this%20broken%20mind%0A%0AI%20pretend%20like%20I%27ve%20got%20my%20shit%20together%0ABut%20really%20I%20don%27t%20know%20what%20the%20fuck%20I%27m%20doing%0AThrow%20away%20anyone%20who%20dares%20to%20love%20me%0ANow%20alone%20on%20the%20curb%20wishing%20I%20never%20did%0A%0AI%20talk%20about%20never%20regretting%20anything%0ABut%20really%20i%20regret%20like%20my%20whole%20fucking%20life%0AI%20wish%20I%20could%20just%20undo%20so%20many%20things%0AI%20hate%20myself%20looking%20at%20the%20fucking%20shitty%20stupid%20tattoos%20that%20I%27m%20left%20with%0AI%20hate%20how%20I%20look%20and%20sound%0AI%20hate%20all%20the%20music%20I%20make%0AI%20hate%20how%20I%20try%20to%20feel%20important%20but%20just%20make%20myself%20look%20like%20a%20self%20important%20fucking%20asshole%0AI%20hate%20how%20my%20body%20feels%0AI%20hate%20how%20everybody%20sees%20me%0AI%20hate%20how%20I%20can%27t%20figure%20out%20what%20I%20am%0AAnd%20I%20bet%20they%20all%20see%20me%20as%20a%20fucking%20guy%20anyway%0A%0AEvery%20day%20is%20the%20fucking%20same%0AI%20look%20for%20something%20that%20isn%27t%20there%0ABecause%20I%20fucking%20threw%20it%20away%0AAll%20the%20people%20who%20thought%20I%20would%20care%0A%0AThis%20life%20is%20so%20fucking%20tiring%0ASometimes%20I%20wish%20it%20would%20all%20just%20go%20over%0ABut%20I%27m%20too%20much%20of%20a%20fucking%20coward%0ASo%20I%20just%20resent%20the%20way%20things%20are%0A%0AI%20wish%20someone%20took%20all%20this%20pain%20from%20me%0AI%20wish%20my%20ex%20fucking%20messaged%20me%0AI%20wish%20my%20life%20wasn%27t%20a%20tragedy%0AI%20wish%20I%20was%20where%20I%27m%20meant%20to%20be%0A%0APlease%20just%20make%20the%20pain%20stop%0APlease%20just%20let%20me%20be%20who%20I%20want%20to%20be%0APlease%20just%20make%20me%20happy%0APlease%20just%20let%20me%20think%20it%27ll%20be%20okay
