album-artist=Roberto%20Cacciapaglia
comment=First%20known%20CD%20release%20of%20the%20%5Burl%3Dhttps%3A//www.discogs.com/Ann-Steel-Ann-Steel/master/17587%5DAnn%20Steel%20album%5B/url%5D.%20The%20track%20listing%20differs%20slightly%20from%20the%20original%20release.%20Track%20seven%2C%20%22My%20Time%2C%22%20has%20been%20moved%20to%20the%20first%20position%2C%20and%20track%20nine%20and%20ten%2C%20%22Media%22%20and%20%22Sweet%20Life%2C%22%20are%20bonus%20tracks%20not%20included%20on%20the%20original%20LP.%0A%0AThe%20CD%20insert%20is%20a%2010-page%20color%20booklet%20including%20a%20track%20list%2C%20lyrics%2C%20and%20photographs.%0A%0ABack%20cover%3A%0ADedicated%20to%20the%20life%20and%20work%20of%20Guglielmo%20Marconi.%0A%0AThe%20expedition%20of%20the%20sound%20hunters%20started%20off%20in%20Milan%20where%20the%20sounds%20were%20successfully%20captured%20amid%20dangers%20and%20difficulties.%0AThe%20sounds%20preciously%20guarded%20in%20the%20tapes%20were%20tamed%20and%20mastered%20in%20London.%0AFirst%20supplies%3A%20Uberto%20dal%20Pozzo%0AMilano%20-%20London%2C%201979%0ADigitally%20remastered%20by%20Marco%20Zangirolami%20at%20Noize%20Studio%2C%20Milano%202003%0AExecutive%20Producer%3A%20Roy%20Tarrant%20for%20Recording%20Arts%0A%0AFor%20concerts%20%26%20events%20contact%20-%0ATemple%20Music%20Management%0ATel%3A%200039%20051%20379871%20/%200039%20348%203940840%0A%0AE-mail%3A%20pensada%40libero.it%20-%20www.robertocacciapaglia.com%0A%0ACD%3A%0ARecording%20Arts%0A%E2%84%97%20%26%20%C2%A9%202003%0AProper%0ABIEM%20MCPS%0AMade%20in%20EEC%0A%0AOriginally%20mastered%20in%201979%0ADigitally%20remastered%20in%202003
