lyrics=filling%20all%20imagined%20spaces%20with%20everything%20thats%20painful%20to%20me%0Aand%20all%20the%20things%20that%20i%20hate%20the%20most%0Aand%20lying%20down%20inside%20them%20and%20staying%20there%0Auntil%20theres%20nowhere%20else%20to%20go%0A%0Ai%20dont%20have%20much%20attachment%0Ato%20the%20dying%20vessel%20im%20in%0Aand%20if%20youre%20the%20one%20to%20take%20me%20then%20i%20dont%20care%20where%20that%20is%0A%0Ai%20dont%20care%20if%20you%20think%20its%20sickness%0Ait%20wouldnt%20change%20things%20anyway%0Aim%20tired%20of%20having%20to%20pretend%20i%20understand%20or%20that%20i%20want%20to%20live%0A%0Aif%20i%20could%20talk%20to%20god%0Aand%20show%20him%20what%20ive%20seen%0Awould%20he%20regret%20everything%20he%20did%20to%20you%20and%20me%3F%0A%0Ai%20think%20i%20once%20was%20someone%0Awho%20had%20dreams%20of%20their%20own%0Abefore%20i%20killed%20the%20only%20part%20of%20me%20that%20had%20any%20hope%0A%0Aand%20i%20want%20you%20to%20take%20me%0Ato%20a%20land%20thats%20far%20from%20him%0Awhere%20i%20am%20free%20to%20dream%20of%20me%20when%20i%20was%20free%20of%20sin%0A%0Aand%20perhaps%20you%20could%20have%20shown%20me%0Awhat%20i%20could%20have%20been%0Aif%20i%20hadnt%20ruined%20every%20opportunity%20that%20ive%20been%20in%0A%0Ai%20know%20you%20dont%20believe%20me%0Awhen%20i%20say%20im%20not%20from%20earth%0Athat%20i%20was%20born%20outside%20the%20stars%20that%20are%20dying%20around%20us%0A%0Aand%20i%20long%20to%20return%20there%0Ato%20the%20place%20where%20you%20and%20me%0Aare%20free%20to%20sing%20our%20final%20song%20where%20the%20stars%20meet%20the%20sea
